# Intent: self.face.snapshot (bench builds only) never showed the overlays or the screen effects: they are drawn on the pixels in the display flush hook, after LVGL, and the snapshot takes the LVGL picture only, so every overlay picture of integrations 2 and 3 looked empty even while the overlays ran. maipai_fx_snapshot_post now runs the same two passes (the overlays with the face and text zones protected, then the scanlines, colour mode, dim and glow) over the snapshot picture, with the LVGL lock held.
# Placement: unit (bench build only; the plain image has no snapshot tool and is byte for byte unchanged)
# Upstream: firmware/main/hal/maipai_fx.cc, maipai_fx.h and maipai_facebench.cc (ours, patches TA02, O03, FI03)
# Check after a flash (bench image): start an overlay (self.overlay.set stormy heavy), then self.face.snapshot shows the clouds, rain and lightning around the eyes; with CRT on the scanlines show in the picture.

